  "details": "Occasionally after an extended period of time or perhaps due to a nefarious avatar (unconfirmed) the mic will suddenly stop working, ie vrchat will no longer detect mic input despite the OS still seeing the mic and receiving input just fine. Seemingly the only way to fix this is to rejoin the world. The mic seems to always come back immediately after world rejoin.",
